.widget_preview/

# Android / Kotlin cache
.kotlin/
android/.kotlin/

# Signing material, anywhere in the tree.
#
# android/.gitignore already covers these, but only under android/. A keystore
# saved to the repository root — which is where a file dialog defaults to —
# was not ignored. Keeping it outside the repository entirely is still the
# right answer; this is the second lock, not the first.
#
# Never publicly share a keystore: https://flutter.dev/to/reference-keystore
key.properties
*.jks
*.keystore
*.p12
*.pfx
